I've wrapped the ProjectHoverCard component with the ScopeProvider from the scope context. This should resolve the error since the useScope hook will now have access to the required context.

The ScopeProvider is designed to provide organization scope information to its children components. In the preview environment, we're providing an empty initial state, but the provider itself will still allow the useScope hook to function properly.

